# Shell scripts must stay LF regardless of a checkout machine's core.autocrlf
# setting — on Windows, autocrlf converting these to CRLF breaks them when
# invoked via WSL/Git-Bash (POSIX shells choke on the trailing \r), which
# silently broke the Phase 11 deploy pipeline's own __tests__/deploy/* suite
# and scripts/lib/require-github-actor.sh specifically. See
# docs/production-deployment-guide.md for how these scripts are used.
*.sh text eol=lf
